<span class="text-sky-400 font-bold tracking-widest text-xs uppercase mb-3 block"><i class="fas fa-satellite-dish mr-2"></i> Client Terminal</span><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-4 uppercase">Interactive Diagnostics</h2><p class="text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed">Use our proprietary engineering calculators to identify system faults before you call a technician, or calculate the financial loss of an aging chiller plant to justify a replacement to your board of directors.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12"><div class="bg-slate-800/50 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm"><h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-6 uppercase border-b border-slate-700 pb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><i class="fas fa-robot text-sky-400"></i> Fault Diagnostic Tool</h3><div class="atlas-diag-box"><div class="atlas-diag-header"><h3><i class="fas fa-microchip"></i> AI Diagnostic</h3><p>Select your system symptom.</p></div><div class="atlas-diag-grid" id="diag-options">
<button class="atlas-diag-btn" onclick="runDiag('Blowing Warm Air','Probable refrigerant leak. Immediate pressure test required.')"><i class="fas fa-temperature-high"></i> Warm Air</button>
